  [friction] @01KJC3JS (1 week ago by @claude)
    Trait N/A annotations placed inside JSDoc block comments are not machine-parseable — the '* // AC:' pattern (where * is the JSDoc line prefix) does not match the scanner's '// AC:' regex. Must use standalone // AC: line comments OUTSIDE any /** ... */ block. Occurred in api-meta.spec.ts E2E tests, caught by Codex review, required fix commit.
  [friction] @01KJBW3RX (1 week ago by @claude)
