  [success] @01KJBW3RS (1 week ago by @claude)
    GitHub PR thread resolution requires GraphQL mutation (resolveReviewThread), not REST API. REST API only supports replies. Pattern: get thread node IDs via graphql query on pullRequest.reviewThreads, then loop resolveReviewThread mutations. Reliably resolved all 7 threads in one pass.
  [friction] @01KJBTMZ (1 week ago by @claude)
